graph TB
    subgraph Gazebo物理引擎
        GZ[物理仿真]
    end

    subgraph 传感器数据流
        GZ --> |LDS-01 激光| GB1[ros_gz_bridge]
        GZ --> |轮式编码器| GB2[ros_gz_bridge]
        GZ --> |IMU| GB3[ros_gz_bridge]

        GB1 --> |sensor_msgs/LaserScan| SCAN[/scan/]
        GB2 --> |nav_msgs/Odometry| ODOM[/odom/]
        GB3 --> |sensor_msgs/Imu| IMU[/imu/]
    end

    subgraph 控制数据流
        KB[teleop_twist_keyboard] --> |WASD 按键| CMD[/cmd_vel/]
        CMD --> |TwistStamped| GB4[ros_gz_bridge]
        GB4 --> |速度指令| GZ
    end

    subgraph SLAM处理流
        SCAN --> ST[slam_toolbox]
        ODOM --> ST
        TF[/tf/] --> ST

        ST --> |Scan Matching| POSE[位姿估计]
        ST --> |Loop Closure| LC[回环检测]
        ST --> |Graph Optimization| OPT[全局优化]

        OPT --> |nav_msgs/OccupancyGrid| MAP[/map/]
        OPT --> |tf2_msgs/TFMessage odom map| TF
    end

    subgraph 可视化流
        MAP --> RV[rviz2]
        SCAN --> RV
        ODOM --> RV
        TF --> RV
    end

    style GZ fill:#e3f2fd
    style ST fill:#ff5722,color:#fff
    style KB fill:#2196f3,color:#fff
    style RV fill:#9c27b0,color:#fff
    style SCAN fill:#ffe0b2
    style ODOM fill:#ffe0b2
    style MAP fill:#ffcdd2
